Methods first published in this repository, with the release that introduced them
(see CHANGELOG.md):

  - Temporal structural causal models with declared mechanism priors and
    out-of-support flagging (0.2.0)
  - Marketing worlds with answer keys for grading marketing mix models, and
    week-by-week play-forward of budget plans from posterior curves (0.4.0)
  - Worlds compiled from a marketing knowledge graph, simulated lift tests, and
    the estimator-agnostic grading harness (0.5.0)
